    ; bindDestructuringAssignmentFlow. THE order swap, and it is real: the
    ; operands of `({a} = b)` are bound left-then-right at the top level and
    ; right-then-left one level in — an object literal declares an anonymous
    ; symbol and a symbol per property, so which side is walked first decides the
    ; SEQUENCE the symbols are created in, which the dump compares by index.
    ;
