    ; ModifiersBase because the JSDoc reparser hangs `@public`/`@readonly` off a
    ; `this.x = 1` assignment), so a port that reached for bind_each_child here
    ; would bind a child the reference does not.
    ;
    ; ★★ THE LOGICAL BRANCH'S POINT IS `has_flow_effects`: a junction label is
    ; built for `a && b`, and if NOTHING under it diverted control the label is
    ; thrown away and the flow the expression started with is restored. That is
    ; what keeps `if (a && b)` from adding two nodes per operand to every graph.
