    ; ── `this.a = x` (slice 42) ─────────────────────────────────────────────

    ; bindThisPropertyAssignment. The fourth assignment-declaration kind, and the
    ; one that is a thing of its own: the other three declare into a FILE's or an
    ; entity's exports, this one declares into the CLASS the assignment's `this`
    ; belongs to.
